@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-70 - Receive Chat Reply

actor "Guest" as Actor
boundary "Chat Widget / Admin Chat UI" as FE
control "ChatController" as API
control "ChatService" as Service
database "MongoDB: chatConversations" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-70
FE -> API: GET /chat/conversations/:id
API -> Service: Execute Receive Chat Reply
Service -> DB: Read/write chatConversations
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: User nhận được reply từ admin

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã gửi tin nhắn
Post: User nhận được reply từ admin
Main flow:
1. User refresh hoặc poll
2. System gọi API GET /chat/conversations/:id
3. System trả về messages[] mới nhất
4. User thấy admin reply trong widget
end note
@enduml
